---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Preview installation of an owned private HTTPS user service; --confirm applies it

Usage: mxr serve setup [OPTIONS] --public-origin <PUBLIC_ORIGIN>

Options:
      --public-origin <PUBLIC_ORIGIN>
      --listen <LISTEN>                [default: 127.0.0.1:18741]
      --dry-run
      --confirm
      --format <FORMAT>                Structured output (json or jsonl) [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help                           Print help
